Models
We studied seven configurations chosen to vary model family, scale, reasoning and post-training stage (Ta-ble 2):

1.Qwen3.8-27B with thinking disabled and enabled;
2.Gemma-4-31B-it and Gemma-4-12B-it;
3.the SFT, DPO and final checkpoints of OLMo-3-7B-Instruct.

All models were run in BF16 from weights pinned to exact repository revisions, using vLLM (Kwon et al., 2023) with sampling parameters taken from each model card (Qwen Team, 2026; Google, 2026; Allen Institute for AI, 2026).
